### 1. Créer un candidat (commun-service via la gateway) puis copier le token
POST http://localhost:8080/skillmatch/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"nom":"Amir","email":"amir.candidat@esprit.tn","password":"123456","role":"CANDIDAT"}

### 2. Se connecter
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/skillmatch/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"amir.candidat@esprit.tn","password":"123456"}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### 3. Créer une alerte -> 201
POST http://localhost:8080/skillmatch/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"motsCles":["java","spring boot"],"localisation":"Tunis","contrat":"CDI","frequence":"IMMEDIATE"}

### 4. Même alerte -> 409
POST http://localhost:8080/skillmatch/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"motsCles":["Spring Boot","JAVA"],"localisation":"tunis","contrat":"CDI"}

### 5. Mes alertes -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/skillmatch/alerts/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Désactiver l'alerte 1 -> 200
PUT http://localhost:8080/skillmatch/alerts/1/active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"active":false}

### 7. Sauvegarder l'offre 10 -> 201 (puis 409 la deuxième fois)
POST http://localhost:8080/skillmatch/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"offerId":10}

### 8. Mes favoris -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/skillmatch/favorites/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Sans token -> 401
GET http://localhost:8080/skillmatch/alerts/me

### 10. Données invalides -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/skillmatch/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"motsCles":[]}

### 11. Back office : créer un compte ADMIN (renseigner adminToken avec le token reçu)
POST http://localhost:8080/skillmatch/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"nom":"Admin Alertes","email":"admin.alertes@skillmatch.tn","password":"123456","role":"ADMIN"}

### 12. Toutes les alertes (ADMIN) -> 200 ; avec un token CANDIDAT -> 403
GET http://localhost:8080/skillmatch/alerts/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 13. Désactiver une alerte (ADMIN) -> 200
PUT http://localhost:8080/skillmatch/alerts/admin/1/active
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"active":false}

### 14. Tous les favoris (ADMIN) -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/skillmatch/favorites/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 15. Supprimer un favori (ADMIN) -> 204
DELETE http://localhost:8080/skillmatch/favorites/admin/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

